- Add system-prompt rules requiring successful tool results before claiming a change and avoiding unnecessary confirmation for requested changes. ([#223](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/223))
- Convert ticket summary timestamps to the configured user timezone before including them in the model prompt. ([#222](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/222))
- Return failed knowledge-base searches as tool errors while keeping the unavailable path distinct. ([#220](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/220))
